msgstr "e. Keiner der oben genannten\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Discussion questions: {#discussion-questions}"
msgstr "Diskussionsfragen: {#discussion-questions}"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Three friends are discussing quantum measurements and operators. Friend A "
"says, \"Making a measurement along $z$ and acting with the operator "
"$\\sigma_z$ are the same thing.\" Friend B says, \"Well, they are different "
"procedures, but they have the same result.\" Friend C says, \"They are "
"totally different; they even have different effects on most states.\" With "
"whom do you agree and why?\n"
msgstr ""
"Drei Freunde diskutieren über Quantenmessungen und Operatoren. Freund A "
"sagt: „Eine Messung entlang $z$ und die Anwendung des Operators $\\sigma_z$ "
"sind dasselbe.\" Freund B sagt: „Nun ja, es sind verschiedene Verfahren, "
"aber sie haben dasselbe Ergebnis.\" Freund C sagt: „Sie sind völlig "
"verschieden; sie haben sogar unterschiedliche Auswirkungen auf die meisten "
"Zustände.\" Wem stimmst du zu und warum?\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Free response problems: {#free-response-problems}"
msgstr "Aufgaben zur freien Bearbeitung: {#free-response-problems}"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Given the experimental observations and proposed syntax:\n"
msgstr ""
"Zeige anhand der experimentellen Beobachtungen und der vorgeschlagenen "
"Notation:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$P_{\\uparrow+x}=\\vert \\begin{pmatrix}1 & 0\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}a \\\\ b\\end{pmatrix}\\vert^2 = |a|^2 =\\frac{1}{2} $$\n"
"$$P_{\\downarrow+x}=\\vert \\begin{pmatrix}0 & 1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}a \\\\ b\\end{pmatrix}\\vert^2 = |b|^2 =\\frac{1}{2} $$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$P_{\\uparrow+x}=\\vert \\begin{pmatrix}1 & 0\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}a \\\\ b\\end{pmatrix}\\vert^2 = |a|^2 =\\frac{1}{2} $$\n"
"$$P_{\\downarrow+x}=\\vert \\begin{pmatrix}0 & 1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}a \\\\ b\\end{pmatrix}\\vert^2 = |b|^2 =\\frac{1}{2} $$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "show that up to a global phase\n"
msgstr "dass bis auf eine globale Phase gilt:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$|+\\rangle_x = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\begin{pmatrix}1 \\\\ "
"e^{i\\alpha}\\end{pmatrix}$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$|+\\rangle_x = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\begin{pmatrix}1 \\\\ "
"e^{i\\alpha}\\end{pmatrix}$$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Choose $\\alpha = 0$ to obtain the standard result.\n"
msgstr "Wähle $\\alpha = 0$, um das Standardergebnis zu erhalten.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$P_{\\uparrow-x}=\\vert \\begin{pmatrix}1 & 0\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}a \\\\ b\\end{pmatrix}\\vert^2 = |a|^2 =\\frac{1}{2} $$\n"
"$$P_{\\downarrow-x}=\\vert \\begin{pmatrix}0 & 1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}a \\\\ b\\end{pmatrix}\\vert^2 = |b|^2 =\\frac{1}{2} $$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$P_{\\uparrow-x}=\\vert \\begin{pmatrix}1 & 0\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}a \\\\ b\\end{pmatrix}\\vert^2 = |a|^2 =\\frac{1}{2} $$\n"
"$$P_{\\downarrow-x}=\\vert \\begin{pmatrix}0 & 1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}a \\\\ b\\end{pmatrix}\\vert^2 = |b|^2 =\\frac{1}{2} $$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "And using the result from challenge problem 3:\n"
msgstr "Und unter Verwendung des Ergebnisses aus Bonusaufgabe 3:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$P_{+x-x}=\\vert \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\begin{pmatrix}1 & "
"1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}c \\\\ d\\end{pmatrix}\\vert^2 = "
"\\frac{1}{2}|c+d|^2 =0 $$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$P_{+x-x}=\\vert \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\begin{pmatrix}1 & "
"1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}c \\\\ d\\end{pmatrix}\\vert^2 = "
"\\frac{1}{2}|c+d|^2 =0 $$\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "$$|-\\rangle_x = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\begin{pmatrix}1 \\\\ -1\\end{pmatrix}$$\n"
msgstr "$$|-\\rangle_x = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\begin{pmatrix}1 \\\\ -1\\end{pmatrix}$$\n"

